{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_no",
      "hash": "a0daaf066ccf7654",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗯……只憑[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳那些同行寶可夢\\n恐怕有點困難呢。\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳帶點別的寶可夢來吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_01",
      "hash": "a219e9066dde7cd4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇！寶可夢在[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳身上的樣子\\n真的好可愛啊～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_02",
      "hash": "a219ec066dde81ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "可是，這對我來說也許有點重呢！\\n所以我選擇和牠們一起走！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub089_poke_01",
      "hash": "c5112ae0eeabb71c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "走路草「來走！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub089_sys_01",
      "hash": "a5d2d2d2dfdd9d82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在[VAR COLOR(0006)]Ｘ選單[VAR COLOR(0000)]的同行寶可夢中\\n選擇寶可夢，\\c\\n再把牠「[VAR COLOR(0006)]從球裡放出[VAR COLOR(0000)]」，\\n就能和牠一起走了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_03",
      "hash": "a219eb066dde803a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這一定會很可愛的！\\n我來幫[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳弄吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub089_jeveniles_04",
      "hash": "a219e6066dde77bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只要和寶可夢在一起，\\n就算只是走路也很開心～！\\r\\n……我想[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳早就知道了吧！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_089_max",
      "hash": "e356cfde9ef85cf9"
    }
  ]
}
